ssolerà ogni cosa. Più tempo Ashley trascorre con il padre, più segreti scopre sul suo passato ma il tempo stringe e intanto sull’isola è sbarcato un nuovo, pericoloso nemico con cui dover fare i conti: il boss della malavita Donnie.","tagline":"Le persone cambiano. Gli assassini no."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"When Ashley and her young daughter Sarah get caught up in a criminal enterprise that puts their lives at risk, she turns to the only person who can help: her estranged father Matt, currently living the life of a retired beach bum in the Cayman Islands. Their reunion is fleeting as they are soon tracked down on the island by crime boss Donnie and his lieutenant Bobo. As Ashley, Sarah, and Matt become entangled in an increasingly dangerous web, Ashley quickly learns her father had a secret past that she knew nothing about and that there is more to her father than meets the eye.","tagline":"People change. Assassins don't."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yuZbAN19eymwi6H9K65HxE007P2.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tMi07ApKsBuyHPmbznWnBedWFmf.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":866346,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yuZbAN19eymwi6H9K65HxE007P2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yuZbAN19eymwi6H9K65HxE007P2.jpg","language":"it","width":1108,"height":1642},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yuZbAN19eymwi6H9K65HxE007P2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yuZbAN19eymwi6H9K65HxE007P2.jpg","language":"it","width":1108,"height":1642},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iFGFIh01gWqfhtArf28Q7M82ejT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iFGFIh01gWqfhtArf28Q7M82ejT.jpg","language":"it","width